# --- Environnement virtuel Python (ne jamais versionner) ---
ArtifactRemovalTransformer/ART312/
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/

# --- Poids de modeles (> 100 Mo, fournis separement par l'equipe) ---
*.pth
*.pth.tar
*.tar
*.ckpt

# --- Donnees publiques tierces (lourdes, telechargeables separement) ---
EEGdenoiseNet/
Code/Brut/
Code/Prétraité/
Code/Nettoyé/
Code/Final/

# --- Donnees de demo GCTNet-main (lourdes, regenerables via son preprocess) ---
GCTNet-main/**/data/*.npy

# --- Telechargements incomplets / fichiers temporaires ---
*.crdownload
*.part
*.tmp

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# --- LaTeX (fichiers auxiliaires de compilation) ---
*.aux
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.out
*.toc
build.log

# --- Notes LaTeX (gardees en local, hors depot : 1 - Metrics ... 6 - Planning) ---
/[0-9] - */
/[0-9] - *.pdf

# --- Outillage / config locale ---
.claude/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
